## Metrics

### Pipeline Completion Rate

Percentage of test cases producing all required output sections.

### Log Detection Rate

Percentage of test cases where an exception or error was successfully detected.

### Failure Point Detection Rate

Percentage of stack traces where a failure point was identified.

### Root Cause Availability

Percentage of test cases producing a root cause hypothesis.

### Remediation Availability

Percentage of test cases producing at least one recommended fix.

### Duplicate Detection

Number of historical bugs returned as semantic matches.

## Important Note

The automated test script calculates engineering validation metrics. These should not be interpreted as scientific model accuracy unless manually labelled ground-truth data is available.

